class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p
id="tw-target-text" class="tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta" dir="ltr" data-placeholder="Traduzione"><span
class="Y2IQFc" lang="en">Access to the Castle area is <strong>free and open</strong>.</span></p><p
id="tw-target-text" class="tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta" dir="ltr" data-placeholder="Traduzione"><span
class="Y2IQFc" lang="en">The visit inside the fortress is allowed only by <strong><a
href="https://www.ticketlandia.com/m/fondazione-brescia-musei">purchasing the ticket</a> </strong>for the <a
href="https://www.bresciamusei.com/en/museums-and-venues/luigi-marzoli-arms-and-armor-museum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Museo delle Armi <em>Luigi Marzoli</em></strong></a> and the <strong><a
href="https://www.bresciamusei.com/en/museums-and-venues/museum-of-the-risorgimento-lioness-of-italy-eng/">Museum of the Risorgimento <em>Lioness of Italy</em></a></strong>.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-118552 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-118552" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Opening times</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p
id="tw-target-text" class="tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta" dir="ltr" data-placeholder="Traduzione"><span
class="Y2IQFc" lang="en">The Castle of Brescia is open <strong>every day</strong>, 365 days a year.<br
/>
Opening hours <strong>may vary in case of events</strong>.</span></p><p
dir="ltr" data-placeholder="Traduzione"><p
dir="ltr" data-placeholder="Traduzione"><strong>23 May 2024 &#8211; 08 September 2024:</strong></p></div><div
class="relative py-6"><div
class="flex justify-between relative py-4 border-b border-gray-100"><div
class="text-primary text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-3/5">
Monday &#8211; Tuesday</div><div
class="text-secondary text-left text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-2/5 pl-6 lg:pl-12">
from 6 a.m. to 1.30 a.m.</div></div><div
class="flex justify-between relative py-4 border-b border-gray-100"><div
class="text-primary text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-3/5">
Wednesday &#8211; Thursday</div><div
class="text-secondary text-left text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-2/5 pl-6 lg:pl-12">
from 6 a.m. to 2.30 a.m.</div></div><div
class="flex justify-between relative py-4 border-b border-gray-100"><div
class="text-primary text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-3/5">
Friday &#8211; Saturday and pre-holidays</div><div
class="text-secondary text-left text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-2/5 pl-6 lg:pl-12">
from 6 a.m. to 3 a.m.</div></div><div
class="flex justify-between relative py-4 border-b border-gray-100"><div
class="text-primary text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-3/5">
Sundays and public holidays</div><div
class="text-secondary text-left text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-2/5 pl-6 lg:pl-12">
from 6 a.m. to 2 a.m.</div></div><div
class="flex justify-between relative py-4 border-b border-gray-100"><div
class="text-primary text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-3/5">
<b>9 September 2024 &#8211; 22 May 2025:</b></div><div
class="text-secondary text-left text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-2/5 pl-6 lg:pl-12"></div></div><div
class="flex justify-between relative py-4 border-b border-gray-100"><div
class="text-primary text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-3/5">
Monday &#8211; Sunday</div><div
class="text-secondary text-left text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl w-1/2 lg:w-2/5 pl-6 lg:pl-12">
from 6 a.m. to 11 p.m.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-118553 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-118553" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Infopoint</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">The Infopoint is the Castle’s tourist information point.</span></p><p><strong>For information:</strong><br
/>
<a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#4320223037262f2f2c0321312630202a222e3630262a6d202c2e"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f99a988a8d9c959596b99b8b9c8a9a9098948c8a9c90d79a9694">[email&#160;protected]</span> </a></p><p>T. 030 8174400</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section
