class="grid grid-cols-8 lg:grid-cols-24 gap-6"><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-start-2 lg:col-span-7 order-last lg:order-none"><h2 class="text-xl xl:text-3xl text-secondary mb-6 lg:mb-12">Via Castello, 9 &#8211; Brescia</h2><div
class="relative mb-6 lg:mb-12"><div
class="accordion accordion-738522 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-738522" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">By Bus and subway</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><ul><li>by bus: <span
style="font-weight: 400;">check bus routes on the <a
href="https://www.bresciamobilita.it/map#/mode=busRoutes/poitypes=parking/date=02-11-2021/direction=0/">Brescia Mobilità</a> website</span></li><li><span
style="font-weight: 400;">by subway: San Faustino stop + a 10-minute walk /Piazza Vittoria stop + a 15-minute walk</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-738523 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-738523" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">By Taxi</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><a
href="https://www.radiotaxibrixia.it/">Radio Taxi Brixia</a><br
/>
tel. (+39) 030.35111</p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-738524 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-738524" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Car parking</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">Along the road that leads to the Castle there are several free and pay parking areas, also for people with disabilities.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-738525 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-738525" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Bicimia</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">Go to the <a
href="https://www.bresciamobilita.it/">Brescia Mobilità</a> website to discover this bike service</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-738526 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-738526" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">By Train</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>Reach us by <a
href="https://www.trenord.it/en/">train</a>, then <strong>from Brescia Train Station:</strong></p><ul><li>on foot: <span
style="font-weight: 400;">20-minute walk, direction Castello</span></li><li><span
style="font-weight: 400;">by subway: San Faustino stop + 10-minute walk / Vittoria stop + 15-minute walk</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-738527 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-738527" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">By Plane</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><strong>Aeroporto Gabriele D’Annunzio Brescia Airport </strong><br
/>
(20 Km from Brescia)</p><p><strong>Orio Al Serio Bergamo Airport</strong><br
/>
(56 Km from Brescia)</p><p><strong>Valerio Catullo Verona Airport</strong><br
/>
(70 Km from Brescia)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-start-10 lg:col-span-15">
